# CoWork: never commit credentials or host runtime state
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
**/secrets.json
**/reviewer.config.json
**/policy.local.json
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/*.log
# Gitignore is not a security boundary; publication requires content scanning.
